      "manualSteps": [],
      "referencedIds": [
        "fld0VFB3UfSf4gCkp",
        "fldQxBIDhmdbCj9Tn",
        "fldpThwtKAXHfQNut",
        "tblB1t18q6aUTNI0g",
        "tblHzGiB591W3GpoZ",
        "wflY5xS7RjU4W047M"
      ],
      "sourceFile": "source/link-stage-2-detailed-response-to-applicant.wflY5xS7RjU4W047M.json",
      "description": "Turns the Application ID carried on a BRQ Detailed Response into a real link to the Aurixa Waitlist applicant. This is what makes Stage 1 aware that the applicant progressed: once the link exists, Stage 2 Reached flips to 1 on the waitlist record and Send Stage 2 Invite reads HOLD, so the scheduled Stage 1 reminder skips them. Fires when a response has an Application ID but no Applicant link, which covers both new submissions and records back-filled later. Matching is on Application ID Key (upper-cased and trimmed), so a reference typed by hand — the fallback path when the emailed link has expired — still resolves. When nothing matches, the response is left alone and Applicant Link Status reads \"Unlinked - no matching applicant\"."
    },
